<title>USA: ICN Pharmaceuticals plans to issue notes.</title>
<headline>ICN Pharmaceuticals plans to issue notes.</headline>
<dateline>COSTA MESA, Calif. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICN Pharmaceuticals Inc said Monday it intends to issue $200 million of senior notes through a private placement.</p>
<p>ICN said it expects the transaction to close in August of this year. ICN intends to utilize the proceeds from the offering for general corporate purposes including the repayment of debt and for acquisitions to supplement its expansion program.</p>
</text>
